# The image needs pyproject.toml, uv.lock, src/ and configs/ only. Everything else stays out of
# the build context, above all data/ (gigabytes, and not the image's business: the model artifact
# is mounted or read from the registry at runtime).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!configs/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
